{
  "$schema_version": 2,
  "$id": "qk17",
  "$type": "novel",
  "$name": "17K小说",
  "$enabled": true,
  "$weight": 1.0,
  "detail_cache_version": 3,
  "chapter_cache_version": 3,
  "page_cache_version": 3,
  "api_endpoints": {
    "detail": {
      "url": "https://api.17k.com/ck/book/{id}",
      "method": "GET",
      "params": {"appKey": "2406394919"},
      "field_extractors": {
        "title": "bookName",
        "author": "authorPenName",
        "cover": "bigCoverImg",
        "status": "bookStatus.name",
        "summary": "intro"
      },
      "chapters": {
        "api": {
          "url": "https://api.17k.com/ck/book/{id}/{volume_id}/lists",
          "volumes_url": "https://api.17k.com/ck/book/{id}/volumes",
          "volumes_response_path": "data",
          "volume_id_field": "volumeId",
          "params": {"appKey": "2406394919"},
          "response_path": "data",
          "item_fields": {"title": "chapterName", "chapter_id": "chapterId"},
          "url_template": "https://www.17k.com/chapter/{id}/{chapter_id}.html",
          "page_param": "page",
          "page_size": 0,
          "max_pages": 500
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "decryption": {
    "targets": {
      "chapter": {
        "strategy": "aes_cbc_base64",
        "key": "4eae35f1b35977a0",
        "iv": "4eae35f1b35977a0"
      }
    }
  },
  "$metadata": {
    "homepage": "https://www.17k.com",
    "icon": "https://www.17k.com/favicon.ico",
    "description": "17K小说网（www.17k.com）正版小说站（17K小说网官方，芥子、中文在线旗下老牌原创站，以都市/玄幻/热血作品著称）。目录页 /list/{bookId}.html 单页全量章节，正文页 /chapter/{bookId}/{chapterId}.html 为纯文本（免登录可抓全部免费章节，VIP 章仅第一章免费）。搜索、详情、目录和正文均通过 Playwright 执行阿里云 WAF 挑战后提取 DOM；结果 20 条/页。",
    "lang": "zh-CN",
    "region": "cn",
    "tags": [
      "小说",
      "正版",
      "VIP",
      "render"
    ],
    "last_verified": "2026-09-13"
  },
  "transports": {
    "base_url": "https://www.17k.com",
    "headers": {
      "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/126.0.0.0 Safari/537.36",
      "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/avif,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8",
      "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8",
      "Referer": "https://www.17k.com/"
    },
    "timeout": 20,
    "retries": 3,
    "interval_ms": 2000,
    "follow_redirects": true
  },
  "endpoints": {
    "discovery": {
      "list_url": "/top/",
      "list_item": {
        "categories": [
          {
            "title": "排行榜",
            "url": "/top/"
          }
        ]
      },
      "works_list_item": {
        "root_selector": {
          "css": "div.TYPE ul li"
        },
        "fields": {
          "title": {
            "css": "a"
          },
          "url": {
            "css": "a.book",
            "attr": "href"
          },
          "cover": {
            "css": "a.book img",
            "attr": "src"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "search": {
      "base_url": "https://search.17k.com",
      "method": "GET",
      "keyword_param": "c.q",
      "render": "playwright",
      "paginator": {
        "url_template": "https://search.17k.com/search.xhtml?c.st=0&c.q={keyword}"
      },
      "note": "搜索 subdom.search.17k.com 对 requests/urllib 直连恒 405（阿里云反 bot，TLS/JA3 指纹级），curl 200 但 body 压缩二进制不可解析；/ck/book/search/merge JSON API 只返回侧栏「猜你喜欢」推荐，不返回搜索结果 → 必须 playwright 渲染 DOM 提取。搜索页 URL https://search.17k.com/search.xhtml?c.st=0&c.q={keyword}，结果 20 条/页（只抓第 1 页，分页参数 page 渲染路径不支持）。原站站内模糊匹配：搜「近战狂兵」会返回超级兵王/至尊狂兵/极道狂兵等相似书名 → render_config.filter_keyword=false 避免误杀。root_selector 只取 .textlist > .textleft（封面块），天然排除顶部作者卡（div.author、无 /book/ 链接）。渲染结果字段：title=img[alt]（图标书名，a[title] 在整卡上是「标签」非书名，故不用整卡作 root）。",
      "item": {
        "root_selector": {
          "css": ".search-list > .textlist > div.textleft"
        },
        "fields": {
          "title": {
            "css": "img",
            "attr": "alt"
          },
          "url": {
            "css": "a",
            "attr": "href"
          },
          "cover": {
            "css": "img",
            "attr": "src"
          }
        },
        "render_config": {
          "wait_for": ".search-list > .textlist > div.textleft",
          "wait_until": "domcontentloaded",
          "timeout_ms": 45000,
          "extra_delay_ms": 1500,
          "filter_keyword": false
        }
      }
    },
    "detail": {
      "render": "playwright",
      "render_config": {
        "wait_for": ".Info.Sign h1, #bookInfo, h1.Title, dl.Volume",
        "wait_until": "domcontentloaded",
        "timeout_ms": 45000,
        "extra_delay_ms": 1200
      },
      "url_pattern": "/book/\\d+\\.html$",
      "note": "详情页经 Playwright 执行 WAF 挑战后元数据齐全。title=.Info.Sign h1 a；author 从 <meta property=og:title>（《书名》作者著-17K小说网）正则取（meta[name=Keywords] 的书名,作者,.. 正则兜底）；cover=#bookCover img.book src（cdn.static.17k.com 动态图）；status=.Info.Sign .label a:first-child span（连载=span.green/完本=span.gray）；summary=#bookInfo .cont p.intro（text_content 含作者寄语等纯文本）；tags=table tr.label td a span（如 叶军浪/撒旦/热血；完本 8 个）。update 取自 dl.Tab dt.tit em「更新:2026-09-11 12:30:00」，schema 无 update_time 字段仅作参考。",
      "fields": {
        "title": {
          "css": ".Info.Sign h1 a"
        },
        "author": {
          "css": "meta[property='og:title']",
          "attr": "content",
          "regex": "《[^》]*》([^著]+)著",
          "fallback": [
            {
              "css": "meta[name='Keywords']",
              "attr": "content",
              "regex": "^[^,]+,([^,]+)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "cover": {
          "css": "#bookCover img.book",
          "attr": "src"
        },
        "status": {
          "css": ".Info.Sign .label a:first-child span"
        },
        "summary": {
          "css": "#bookInfo .cont p.intro"
        },
        "tags": {
          "css": "table tr.label td a span"
        }
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "chapter": {
        "pagination": {
          "enabled": true,
          "max_pages": 1
        },
        "list": {
          "note": "独立目录页 /list/{bookId}.html（Playwright 执行 WAF 挑战后返回全量章节，5728 章/约 1.3MB）：h1.Title 书名 + div.Author 作者 + dl.Volume 卷（作品相关/正文）×2，卷内 dd 平铺 <a href=/chapter/{bookId}/{chapterId}.html><span class=ellipsis>章名</span></a>。root_selector 直接以章节链接 <a> 为根，url 用 xpath=\".\" 取根节点自身 href（框架字段查询相对各根执行）。目录页无需登录。",
          "chapters_url": "/list/{id}.html",
          "root_selector": {
            "css": "dl.Volume dd a"
          },
          "fields": {
            "title": {
              "css": "span.ellipsis"
            },
            "url": {
              "xpath": ".",
              "attr": "href"
            }
          }
        },
        "body": {
          "note": "正文 /chapter/{bookId}/{chapterId}.html 经 Playwright 执行 WAF 挑战后返回纯文本（UTF-8 无字体混淆），免费章节全文可见；VIP 章免登录仅第一章（约 1-2 段预览后直接结束，框架不支持付费自动化）。容器 #readArea .readAreaBox.content .p 内正文为 <p>，另有页脚广告 p.copy（本书首发来自17K小说网…，text_content 为空）+ div.author-say/qrcode/chapter_text_ad → 用 :not(.copy) 排掉。每章单页无章内分页。章节标题取页面 h1（非目录 span）。",
          "selector": {
            "css": "#readArea .readAreaBox.content .p p:not(.copy)"
          },
          "api": {
            "url": "https://api.17k.com/ckv3/book/{id}/chapter/{chapter_id}",
            "params": {
              "subAllPrice": "1",
              "platform": "4",
              "appKey": "2406394919"
            },
            "response_path": "data.content.0.text",
            "decrypt_target": "chapter"
          },
          "render": "playwright",
          "render_config": {
            "wait_for": "#readArea .readAreaBox.content, #readArea",
            "wait_until": "domcontentloaded",
            "timeout_ms": 45000,
            "extra_delay_ms": 800
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "constraints": {
    "max_concurrency": 1,
    "search": {
      "max_pages": 500,
      "max_results": 30
    },
    "detail": {
      "max_pages": 1
    },
    "chapter": {
      "max_pages": 1,
      "max_items": 10000
    }
  },
  "diagnostics": {
    "selfcheck": {
      "strategy": "off"
    }
  }
}
